              "id": "b",
              "text": "She helped me to carrying the bags."
            }
          ],
          "explanation": "«Help» puede ir con o sin «to»: «helped me (to) carry»."
        },
        {
          "id": "r6",
          "prompt": "At the meeting, the team proposed a break. Which sentence is correct?",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "c",
              "text": "She suggested to us take a break."
